- Double-fault: keep compiler-compliant handler (no explicit return),
  register via transmute to crate-expected `-> !` type; keep IST stack.
- Page-fault: use PageFaultErrorCode (not u64), by-value frame.
- All handlers: by-value InterruptStackFrame, no explicit return types.
- Timer ISR: unchanged logic, minor lint cleanup.
- Remove any phantom imports; align paths to existing project modules.
- Add small touches to reduce warnings (underscore params, inline hints).

